{"timestamp": 1779426418.65427, "event_type": "meeting_called", "tick": 30, "data": {"caller": "player_2", "reason": "Charlie called an emergency meeting", "bodies": [{"room": "weapons", "victim_name": "Bob"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779426418.6551301, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 30, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779426429.3317442, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 30, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I called this emergency meeting because I found Bob's body in weapons. I know I probably should have just reported it there, but I panicked and ran through security and electrical up to the cafeteria to hit the button. \n\nWe are at final three, which means either Diana or Frank is the Duck. We have to get this right right now or we lose the game. I was going from weapons through security and electrical to the cafeteria. Where were you two this round? Did either of you pass near weapons or see each other? Please give your full routes so we can figure this out. I am 100% Goose, so it's between the two of you."}}
{"timestamp": 1779426452.3072991, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 30, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I started storage, went to navigation, then up through security. Late round I went into weapons and saw Bob there with Frank. Bob was alive when I arrived. I got nervous because it\u2019s final three territory, so I didn\u2019t want to hang around with two people stacked there, and I backed out toward security.\n\nFrank came out from weapons right after me and was with me in security when the meeting got called. If Charlie found Bob dead in weapons immediately after that, then Frank is the one who was last actually alone with Bob in that room. I did not see the body, and I didn\u2019t kill Bob. From my perspective this has to be Frank."}}
{"timestamp": 1779426469.7874424, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 30, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Diana, don't fall for this! Charlie is 100% the Duck, and his own story completely exposes him. \n\nThink about what Charlie just said: he claims he found Bob's body in Weapons and panicked, running all the way through Security and Electrical to get to the Cafeteria. First of all, Weapons connects DIRECTLY to the Cafeteria! Why would anyone take a massive detour through three different rooms to hit the button when the Cafeteria is right next door? \n\nSecond, and more importantly, Diana, you and I were BOTH standing in Security when this meeting was called! Did you see Charlie run past us? No! Because he never went through Security. Charlie killed Bob in Weapons right after we left, walked straight into the Cafeteria, and hit the button to try and frame one of us with a completely made-up panic route. \n\nHis story is physically impossible based on where we were standing. We have to vote Charlie right now or we lose!"}}
